-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",55,{
[1729]="70027217\n1\tComplete Hounds of the White Hand\030Complete Servants of the White Hand\030Complete Summons of the White Hand\030Complete Guidance of the White Hand\tGwilum is at the gate to Barnavon. Gwilum has asked you to help him against the Warg-riders in the north.\n2\tTalk to Amlan at his camp in the Gravenwood\tAmlan is encamped beneath the eaves of the Gravenwood. Gwilum asked you to bring word of your successes to the Ranger Amlan.\n",
[1730]="700173AA\n1\tDefeat White Hand archers (total: 10)\030Defeat White Hand leaders (total: 6)\030Defeat Dunlendings in the School at Tham Mírdain (total: 12)\tThe School at Tham Mírdain is located to the south-east of Echad Mirobel. Lefnuichen, an elf at Echad Mirobel, asked that you drive the White Hand out by force, for the uruks and Dunlendings have taken over the School that rightfully belongs to the Elves.\n",
[1731]="7006AE95\n1\tRecover valuable goods (total: 8)\tFind and recover valuable goods scattered amongst the Dead in Ghâr Mejet.\n2\tReturn to Yâshri with the valuable goods\tReturn to Yâshri with the valuable goods. Yâshri can be found just north of Ghâr Mejet.\n",
[1732]="70060D89\n1\tFind Lotho Sackville-Baggins between Needlehole and Yondershire\tLotho Sackville-Baggins can be found in eastern Yondershire, outside of Needlehole. You should travel towards Needlehole with Fredegar Bolger.\n2\tTalk to Lotho Sackville-Baggins outside of Needlehole\tLotho Sackville-Baggins can be found in eastern Yondershire, outside of Needlehole. You should talk to Lotho Sackville-Baggins.\n3\tTalk to Fredegar Bolger\tFredegar Bolger can be found in eastern Yondershire, outside of Needlehole. You should talk to Fredegar Bolger.\n4\tRegroup at the secret Yonder-watch store-house\tA secret Yonder-watch store-house can be found in the woods between Gamwich and Long Cleeve. Fredegar Bolger has asked you to regroup at the secret Yonder-watch store-house.\n5\tTalk to Fredegar Bolger at the secret hideout\tA secret Yonder-watch store-house can be found in the woods between Gamwich and Long Cleeve. You should talk to Fredegar Bolger at the Yonder-watch store-house.\n",
[1733]="7001CC54\n1\tSearch for evidence of violence\030Search for old weapons\030Search for a sign of the Necromancer's influence\tAudaghaim lies to the east of the Haunted Inn in the Dourstocks. You should search Audaghaim carefully for any telling scenes that may have lain hidden during your previous hasty observations of the town.\n2\tTalk to Idhrenfair at the Haunted Inn\tThe Ranger Idhrenfair is in the Haunted Inn, west of Audaghaim. You should return to Idhrenfair and tell him of all you have seen.\n",
[1734]="700469A6\n1\tBring Black Badges to Cannuion at Tinnudir.\030Collect Black Badges (total: 10)\tAngmarim can be found within the ruined walls of Annúminas. Cannuion is at Tinnudir. Cannuion has asked you to bring him the black badges of the Angmarim at Annúminas.\n",
[1735]="7001D0D9\n1\tDestroy ballistae (total: 12)\tOrkish ballistae can be found throughout northern Gathbúrz. Vatnar has asked you to destroy several Orkish ballistae to clear the way for the Malledhrim.\n2\tTalk to Vatnar in Thangúlhad\tVatnar is at Thangúlhad in Gathbúrz. You should return to Vatnar with news of your success.\n",
[1736]="700011D8\n1\tTalk to Lindir\tRivendell lies in the Trollshaws, far to the south of Angmar. You discovered a strange piece of text, written in the Black Speech. The Elves of Rivendell might be able to translate it.\n",
[1737]="7004ABA0\n1\tComplete The Burning Mountain: Black Fire\tCandúr can be found in Udûn. You should talk Candúr.\n2\tCompleted\tCompleted The Burning Mountain: Black Fire.\n",
[1738]="70020EFD\n1\tFind the source of the Shadow-wolves' power\tThe Black Dens lie to the south-east of Echad Dagoras. Amarion has asked you to enter the Black Dens and find the source of the Shadow-wolves' power.\n2\tDouse torches (total: 9)\tShadow-torches can be found throughout the caverns of the Black Dens. You should douse the torches within the Black Dens to break the strange enchantment that summons forth the Shadow-wolves.\n3\tTalk to Amarion at Echad Dagoras\tAmarion is at Echad Dagoras, north-west of the Black Dens. You should return to Amarion with tidings of what you found in the Black Dens.\n",
[1739]="7003720E\n1\tCollect black heartwood from Black Huorns (total: 6)\tBlack Huorns may be found throughout the eaves of Fangorn bordering the Broadacres. Blackthorn asked you to bring him more of the black heartwood, so that he might learn the origin of the corruption.\n2\tBring the black heartwood you collected to Blackthorn\tBlackthorn can be found in the eaves of Fangorn, north of Tordag's encampment. You should bring the Black Huorn heartwood to the Ent Blackthorn.\n",
[1740]="70037212\n1\tCollect black heartwood from Black Huorns (total: 6)\tBlack Huorns may be found throughout the eaves of Fangorn bordering the Broadacres. Blackthorn asked you to bring him more of the black heartwood, so that he might learn the origin of the corruption.\n2\tBring the black heartwood you collected to Blackthorn\tBlackthorn awaits your return in the eaves of Fangorn, bordering the Broadacres. You should bring the black heartwood that you collected to Blackthorn the Ent.\n",
[1741]="70037210\n1\tFind the Ent who shepherds this part of Fangorn\tHaving rampaged through the eaves of Fangorn, you should find the Ent who tends this part of the forest and apologize for your indiscretion.\n2\tFind the Ent who shepherds this part of Fangorn\tBlackthorn is in the eaves of Fangorn, north of Tordag's encampment. You should find the Ent who shepherds this part of Fangorn.\n3\tDefeat Black Huorns in Fangorn (total: 6)\tBlack Huorns may be found throughout the eaves of Fangorn at the edge of the Broadacres. Blackthorn asked you to put an end to the Black Huorns threatening both the lands of men and the Ents.\n4\tBring the black heartwood you found to Blackthorn in Fangorn\tBlackthorn awaits your return in the eaves of Fangorn on the border of the Broadacres. You should bring the piece of black heartwood you found to Blackthorn.\n",
[1742]="700011E6\n1\tTalk to Lindir\tRivendell is in the Trollshaws, far to the south of Angmar. You discovered a strange piece of text, written in the Black Speech. The Elves of Rivendell might be able to translate it.\n",
[1743]="700001F6\n1\tTalk to Lindir\tRivendell is in the Trollshaws, far to the south of Angmar. You discovered a strange piece of text, written in the Black Speech. The Elves of Rivendell might be able to translate it.\n",
[1744]="700011DF\n1\tTalk to Lindir\tRivendell is in the Trollshaws, far to the south of Angmar. You discovered a strange piece of text, written in the Black Speech. The Elves of Rivendell might be able to translate it.\n",
[1745]="70042DB8\n1\tTalk to Mandan at the north-west entrance to Pelargir\tMandan is inside the entrance to Pelargir. Langlas and Mandan are organizing the effort to gather up the weapons the Corsairs cast aside when they fled from the Oath-breakers at Pelargir.\n2\tCollect fallen Corsair swords by the docks in Pelargir (total: 8)\tThe Corsairs cast aside their blades when they fled from the Oath-breakers, and the fallen arms can be found at many places near the docks of Pelargir.\n3\tBring Corsair swords to Mandan at the north-west entrance to Pelargir\tMandan is at the north-west entrance to Pelargir. You have gathered up a number of Corsair blades and should bring them to Mandan.\n4\tTalk to Langlas at the Camp of the Grey Host\tLanglas is at the Camp of the Grey Host, west of the port-city of Pelargir.\n",
[1746]="70042DBB\n1\tTalk to Radanir in the West-garth of Pelargir\tRadanir is in the West-garth of Pelargir, by one of the bridges that leads to the Court of the Ship-kings. Lothrandir has asked you to find Radanir and help him load the ships with supplies.\n2\tPick up the supply crate by Radanir in the West-garth\tThere are crates that need to be carried to the Corsair flagship moored at the large dock on the south end of the Market Ward. Crates can be found by Radanir's position in the West-garth, near one of the bridges to the Market Ward.\n3\tPick up the supply barrel by Radanir in the West-garth\tThere are barrels that need to be carried to the Corsair flagship moored at the large dock on the south end of the Market Ward. Barrels can be found by Radanir's position in the West-garth, near one of the bridges to the Market Ward.\n4\tTalk to Techeron on the Corsair flagship\tTecheron is on the Corsair flagship moored at the large southern dock in the Market Ward, in Pelargir. You have delivered some supplies to the flagship, and now Techeron wants to speak with you.\n5\tTalk to Lothrandir in the Camp of the Grey Host\tLothrandir is at the Camp of the Grey Host, west of the port-city of Pelargir.\n",
[1747]="70042DB9\n1\tTalk to Amlan in the Market Ward, in Pelargir\tAmlan is in the Market Ward in the port-city of Pelargir. Daervunn asked you to help Amlan find maps of the river Anduin to help Aragorn with his journey.\n2\tAmlan did not yet search the crates in a small area in the north-eastern corner of the Market Ward, and they may contain the river-maps you seek.\t\n3\tBring the river maps to Amlan in the Market Ward\tAmlan is in the Market Ward, in Pelargir. You found some maps of the Anduin and should bring them to Amlan.\n4\tBring the river maps to Orthonn in the Court of the Ship-kings\tOrthonn is one of the lore-masters of the Grey Company, and can be found in the Court of the Ship-kings, in Pelargir. Amlan cannot read the maps of the Anduin you recovered, but thinks that Orthonn might be able to learn some useful knowledge from them.\n5\tTalk to Faeron in the Court of the Ship-kings\tFaeron is in the Court of the Ship-kings, in Pelargir. Ranger Faeron heard your conversation with Orthonn and has sought your attention.\n6\tTalk to Daervunn in the Camp of the Grey Host\tDaervunn is at the Camp of the Grey Host, west of the port-city of Pelargir.\n",
[1748]="70042DBA\n1\tTalk to Halbarad near the north-west entrance to Pelargir\tHalbarad is located in the large courtyard just inside the north-west entrance to the port-city of Pelargir.\n2\tTalk to Corunir in Pelargir, somewhere south of Halbarad\tCorunir is somewhere south of Halbarad's position, in Pelargir. Halbarad has asked you to find Corunir and learn how Golodir fares after the passing of the Dead Men.\n3\tTalk to Golodir somewhere south of Corunir, in Pelargir\tCorunir left Golodir standing on a dock somewhere to the south, in the city of Pelargir.\n4\tTalk to Calenglad at the Camp of the Grey Host\tCalenglad is at the Camp of the Grey Host, outside the port-city of Pelargir. Golodir was possessed of an unusually ill temper, and you should return to Calenglad and see what he thinks of the Grey Company's mood following the battle.\n",
[1749]="7001B244\n1\tCollect black poison-glands (total: 8)\tBlackvenom Spiders can be found in the caves at the northern end of the Scuttledells. Miluimil has asked you to gather venom glands from the Blackvenom brood of the Scuttledells, so that he can make an antidote to Delúris' poison.\n2\tTalk to Miluimil at Ivorel's camp\tMiluimil is at Ivorel's camp in the Scuttledells. You should return to Miluimil with the poison-glands you have collected.\n",
[1750]="7001B246\n1\tDefeat Delúris\tDelúris' nest is in the northern Scuttledells, north of Ivorel's camp. Miluimil has asked you to confront and defeat the spider-queen Delúris and has supplied you with the antidote to her venom.\n2\tSpeak with Miluimil in the Scuttledells\tMiluimil is at Ivorel's camp in the Scuttledells, south of Delúris' nest. You should return to Miluimil to tell the tale of Delúris' defeat.\n",
[1751]="7001B1F5\n1\tDefeat Scuttledells crows (total: 16)\tScuttledells crows can be found throughout the Scuttledells. Ivorel has asked you to hunt down Scuttledells crows to prevent them from finding her scouts or reporting back to Dol Guldur.\n2\tTalk to Ivorel at her camp\tIvorel is at her camp in the Scuttledells. You should speak with Ivorel and tell her that many of the Enemy's flying scouts have been slain.\n",
[1752]="70030820\n1\tDefeat Huorns in the Black Heart\tCorrupted Huorns can be found in the Black Heart of Fangorn. You should defeat many corrupted Huorns in the darkest part of the forest.\n2\tDefeat corrupted Huorns (total: 10)\tCorrupted Huorns can be found in the Black Heart of Fangorn. You should defeat many corrupted Huorns in the darkest part of the forest.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many of the bloodthirsty Huorns of Greenroot's corrupted herd. The forest will not be so treacherous for the creatures who wind up lost in the Black Heart.\n",
[1753]="7002D6D8\n1\tHarvest naturally growing crystals from Tharâkh Bazân (total: 8)\tCrystals may be found in Tharâkh Bazân, west of Jazârgund in Durin's Way. Gerwith has asked you to search for natural crystals in Tharâkh Bazân in order to replace ones that have been destroyed.\n2\tReturn the crystals to Gerwith in Tharâkh Bazân\tGerwith is at the encampment on the eastern edge of Tharâkh Bazân. Gerwith awaits your return with the glowing crystals that may be used as sources of light.\n",
[1754]="7000B983\n1\tThe totem of challenge is in the centre of the ruins of Starkhath. Nogmeldir has asked you to find the totem and call out the Warg-leader Blackfang.\t\n2\tTalk to Nogmeldir\tReturn to Nogmeldir at Vindurhal and tell him of Glorwen's capture by the goblins of Goblin-town.\n",
[1755]="700375D7\n1\tLook for Blackthorn's messenger in Torsbury\tThere is a bird nearby. You should tell the bird to warn Blackthorn that Thane Tordag needs his help.\n2\tDefeat Bartub\tBartub is near the old Gondorian ruins in Torsbury. You should help Blackthorn and the Rohirrim defeat Bartub.\n",
[1756]="7000789C\n1\tFind Rurik's master-key (quantity: see journal)\tApplewood has been seen entering the Blackwold's main encampment in the northernmost part of the Chetwood. After learning that Rurik was guilty only of fear, Sageford recalled the name Rurik provided as being a Brigand within the main encampent of the Blackwold in the Chetwood. Sageford wants you to seek Applewood out and obtain the key he stole from Rurik.\n2\tBring Rurik's master-key to Constable Sageford\tConstable Sageford can be found near the centre of Combe. Having found and defeated Applewood, you took the key back from him. Now you should return to Constable Sageford.\n",
[1757]="7000789D\n1\tSearch for valuables\tOld Bauman's farm is deep in the Chetwood, at the end of the eastward path. Constable Sageford believes that if you confront the Blackwolds' leader at Old Bauman's farm, you might be able to recover some of the valuables the Blackwolds have stolen.\n2\tBring the receipt to Constable Sageford in Combe\tConstable Sageford can be found near town-centre in Combe, with his fellow constables. Sageford sent you to confront the leader of the Blackwolds at Old Bauman's farm. You found a receipt signed by a 'Rurik' on the Blackwold's body. Constable Sageford will want to know about this.\n",
[1758]="700173CE\n1\tKill Llygad the Blade\tLlygad the Blade leads the forces of Dunland from within the School at Tham Mírdain, the entrance of which is south-east of Echad Mirobel. Faellion wishes for you to defeat the champion to dismay the Dunlending forces from their warmongering intentions.\n",
[1759]="7002BFFA\n1\tDefeat Khundolar at Lashkarg in the Brown Lands (total: 10)\tKhundolar Easterlings can be found at Lashkarg, south-east of Etheburg in the Brown Lands. Dagbert has asked you to enter Lashkarg, war-camp of the Khundolar, and defeat the Easterling warriors there.\n2\tTalk to Dagbert in the Brown Lands\tDagbert is at Etheburg in the Brown Lands. You should bring news of your victory to Dagbert.\n",
[1760]="7002EA45\n1\tDefeat Khundolar at Lashkarg in the Brown Lands (total: 10)\tKhundolar Easterlings can be found at Lashkarg, south-east of Etheburg in the Brown Lands. Céola has asked you to enter Lashkarg, war-camp of the Khundolar, and defeat the Easterling warriors there in hopes that they will believe Etheburg's numbers greater than they truly are.\n2\tTalk to Céola at Etheburg in the Brown Lands\tCéola is at Etheburg in the Brown Lands. You should bring news of your victory to Céola.\n",
})
